# ALARM packages hosted in [pocknix-base] but installed by no image (opt-in via
# pacman -S on a locked device). The harvest only sees what a build installed, hence
# a hand list; every dep must be hosted too or snapshot-base.sh refuses. dev/pacman-repo.md

# --- VPN / remote access ---
tailscale
wireguard-tools      # no openresolv for wg-quick DNS: conflicts with the base's systemd-resolvconf

# --- file sharing ---
samba

# --- emulation layer (opt-in: no image installs it, Pocknix Tools does) ---
# Its ALARM deps, the optional emulators' included. Derive changes from an orphan set on a
# device, not from the snapshot guard: that reads the metas' depends= only (dev/pacman-repo.md).
retroarch
libretro-core-info
ppsspp
ppsspp-assets        # ppsspp's own deps from here down
sdl2_ttf
openxr
jsoncpp
miniupnpc
glew
glu
boost-libs           # the optional emulators (dolphin-emu, azahar, cemu) from here down
crypto++
enet
fmt
libspng
mbedtls3
pugixml
sfml
soundtouch
zlib-ng

# --- desktop Plasma flavour (opt-in: pacman -S pocknix-desktop-plasma) ---
plasma-desktop
systemsettings
kmenuedit
polkit-kde-agent
